[TECHNICAL_REQUIREMENT]
UID: L3-ANS-001
TITLE: Qube creation
STATEMENT: >>>
When the declared qube does not exist, the qube module shall create it with the
declared class and template.
<<<
EARS_PATTERN: Event-driven
PRODUCT: Ansible
STATUS: Implemented
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: L2P-LIFECYCLE-01
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: File
  ROLE: Implementation
  PATH: qubes-ansible/ansible_collections/qubesos/core/plugins/module_utils/qubes_module_qube.py
  ELEMENT: function
  ID: QubeModule.enforce_existence
- TYPE: File
  ROLE: Implementation
  PATH: qubes-ansible/ansible_collections/qubesos/core/plugins/module_utils/qubes_helper.py
  ELEMENT: function
  ID: QubesHelper.create
- TYPE: File
  ROLE: Verification
  PATH: qubes-ansible/tests/qubes/test_module_qube.py
  ELEMENT: function
  ID: test_lifecycle_full_create_start_shutdown_remove

[TECHNICAL_REQUIREMENT]
UID: L3-ANS-002
TITLE: Qube cloning
STATEMENT: >>>
When a clone source is declared and the qube does not exist, the qube module
shall copy that source.
<<<
EARS_PATTERN: Event-driven
PRODUCT: Ansible
STATUS: Partial
DEFECT: >>>
The clone is taken with ``ignore_devices=True``, so the source qube's device
assignments are not carried over to the copy
(qubes-ansible/ansible_collections/qubesos/core/plugins/module_utils/qubes_module_qube.py:252).
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: L2P-LIFECYCLE-02
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: File
  ROLE: Implementation
  PATH: qubes-ansible/ansible_collections/qubesos/core/plugins/module_utils/qubes_module_qube.py
  ELEMENT: function
  ID: QubeModule.enforce_existence
- TYPE: File
  ROLE: Verification
  PATH: qubes-ansible/tests/qubes/test_module_qube.py
  ELEMENT: function
  ID: test_create_clone_vmtype_combinations

[TECHNICAL_REQUIREMENT]
UID: L3-ANS-003
TITLE: Qube removal
STATEMENT: >>>
When state ``absent`` is declared, the qube module shall delete the qube
together with its volumes.
<<<
EARS_PATTERN: Event-driven
PRODUCT: Ansible
STATUS: Partial
DEFECT: >>>
The wait for the qube to reach the shutdown state is an unbounded ``while True``
loop with no timeout, so a qube that never halts hangs the play
(qubes-ansible/ansible_collections/qubesos/core/plugins/module_utils/qubes_helper.py:319).
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: L2P-LIFECYCLE-03
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: File
  ROLE: Implementation
  PATH: qubes-ansible/ansible_collections/qubesos/core/plugins/module_utils/qubes_helper.py
  ELEMENT: function
  ID: QubesHelper.remove
- TYPE: File
  ROLE: Verification
  PATH: qubes-ansible/tests/qubes/test_module_qube.py
  ELEMENT: function
  ID: test_lifecycle_create_and_absent

