[TECHNICAL_REQUIREMENT]
UID: L3-ANS-016
TITLE: Notes size limit
STATEMENT: >>>
If the declared notes exceed 256 000 bytes, then the qube module shall reject the
change.
<<<
EARS_PATTERN: Unwanted-behaviour
PRODUCT: Ansible
STATUS: Not Implemented
DEFECT: >>>
The module applies notes with no size check of its own, so oversized notes reach
qubesd and the limit is enforced only there
(qubes-ansible/ansible_collections/qubesos/core/plugins/module_utils/qubes_module_qube.py:288).
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: L2P-CONFIG-07
  ROLE: Refines

