[TECHNICAL_REQUIREMENT]
UID: L3-TF-012
TITLE: Notes size limit
STATEMENT: >>>
If the declared notes exceed 256 000 bytes, then the qubes_vm resource shall
reject them before changing any other attribute.
<<<
EARS_PATTERN: Unwanted-behaviour
PRODUCT: Terraform
STATUS: Not Implemented
DEFECT: >>>
No provider or plan-time check bounds ``notes``, so oversized notes reach qubesd
only at apply, after properties, volumes, devices and features were already changed
(qubes-terraform/qubes_provider/utils/qubes_ansible/qubes_module_qube.py:288).
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: L2P-CONFIG-07
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: File
  ROLE: Authority
  PATH: qubes-core-admin/qubes/api/admin.py
  ELEMENT: function
  ID: QubesAdminAPI.vm_notes_set

[TECHNICAL_REQUIREMENT]
UID: L3-TF-013
TITLE: Qube class immutability
STATEMENT: >>>
If the declared class differs from the existing qube's class, then the qubes_vm
resource shall reject the change.
<<<
EARS_PATTERN: Unwanted-behaviour
PRODUCT: Terraform
STATUS: Partial
DEFECT: >>>
``klass`` is ``requires_replace``, so a class change plans a destroy-and-recreate
of the qube and its volumes instead of a rejection
(qubes-terraform/qubes_provider/resources/qube.py:56).
<<<
