[TECHNICAL_REQUIREMENT]
UID: L3-TF-015
TITLE: Volume resize
STATEMENT: >>>
The qubes_vm resource shall resize a declared ``private`` or ``root`` volume to
the declared size.
<<<
EARS_PATTERN: Ubiquitous
PRODUCT: Terraform
STATUS: Partial
DEFECT: >>>
Enforcement compares sizes with ``!=``, so a live volume larger than declared
triggers a shrink that qubesadmin refuses, failing every later update of the qube
(qubes-terraform/qubes_provider/utils/qubes_ansible/qubes_module_qube.py:387).
<<<
