[TECHNICAL_REQUIREMENT]
UID: L3-TF-039
TITLE: Template signature verification
STATEMENT: >>>
When the qubes_vm resource installs a template, the qubes_vm resource shall
reject a template package whose signature does not verify.
<<<
EARS_PATTERN: Event-driven
PRODUCT: Terraform
STATUS: Partial
RATIONALE: >>>
Repository downloads are verified by qvm-template itself, which ignores
--nogpgcheck for downloaded templates.
<<<
DEFECT: >>>
An rpm origin always passes --nogpgcheck, so a local template package installs
with no signature check
(qubes-terraform/qubes_provider/utils/qubes_adapter.py:341).
<<<
