UID: L3-TF-061
TITLE: Existing policy file protection
STATEMENT: >>>
If the named policy file already exists when the resource is created, then the qubes_policy
resource shall fail the apply without overwriting it.
<<<
EARS_PATTERN: Unwanted-behaviour
PRODUCT: Terraform
STATUS: Not Implemented
RATIONALE: >>>
An overwritten policy file silently changes qrexec access control that no declaration owns.
<<<
DEFECT: >>>
Create replaces the file with the ``any`` token, so an existing file of that name is silently
overwritten (qubes-terraform/qubes_provider/utils/policy.py:144).
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: L2P-SYSTEM-05
  ROLE: Refines

