While a declared object's live state is equivalent to its declaration, the provider shall report no
difference on refresh.
<<<
EARS_PATTERN: State-driven
PRODUCT: Terraform
STATUS: Implemented
RATIONALE: >>>
Terraform list and map attributes have no semantic-equality hook, so a cosmetic mismatch would show
as a perpetual diff.
<<<
