[TECHNICAL_REQUIREMENT]
UID: L3-TF-035
TITLE: Command execution in qube
STATEMENT: >>>
The provider shall run a declared command inside a qube and report that
command's exit status.
<<<
EARS_PATTERN: Ubiquitous
PRODUCT: Terraform
STATUS: Workaround
DEFECT: >>>
The provider registers no execution resource, so a command runs only through
Terraform's generic local-exec provisioner invoking qvm-run from the Terraform host
(qubes-terraform/qubes_provider/provider/provider.py:45).
<<<
