TITLE: Security

[TECHNICAL_REQUIREMENT]
UID: L3-TF-040
TITLE: Opaque qube-reported values
STATEMENT: >>>
The qubes_vm resource shall handle feature values read from a qube only as opaque
strings for comparison, never parsing or executing them.
<<<
EARS_PATTERN: Ubiquitous
PRODUCT: Terraform
STATUS: Implemented
RATIONALE: >>>
Some features are set at a qube's own request, so their values are untrusted
input reaching the provider's host.
<<<
