[TECHNICAL_REQUIREMENT]
UID: L3-TF-044
TITLE: Error attribution
STATEMENT: >>>
If a qubes_vm operation fails, then the qubes_vm resource shall report an error
diagnostic naming the failed operation and the qube.
<<<
EARS_PATTERN: Unwanted-behaviour
PRODUCT: Terraform
STATUS: Partial
DEFECT: >>>
Read, update and delete diagnostics carry only the exception text, omitting the
qube name that the create diagnostic includes
(qubes-terraform/qubes_provider/resources/qube.py:191).
<<<
