[TECHNICAL_REQUIREMENT]
UID: L3-TF-054
TITLE: Missing dependency reporting
STATEMENT: >>>
If qubesadmin cannot be imported, then the provider shall fail with a message
naming that dependency.
<<<
EARS_PATTERN: Unwanted-behaviour
PRODUCT: Terraform
STATUS: Not Implemented
DEFECT: >>>
provider.py imports data_sources/system.py first, whose unguarded qubesadmin import
crashes plugin startup with a bare ModuleNotFoundError before the guarded message in
qubes_adapter.py can run (qubes-terraform/qubes_provider/data_sources/system.py:15).
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: L2S-DIAG-02
  ROLE: Refines

[TECHNICAL_REQUIREMENT]
UID: L3-TF-045
TITLE: Diagnostic verbosity control
STATEMENT: >>>
Where Terraform logging is enabled, the provider shall log each Qubes Admin API
operation it performs.
<<<
EARS_PATTERN: Optional-feature
PRODUCT: Terraform
STATUS: Not Implemented
DEFECT: >>>
The provider contains no logging calls and its Ansible shim makes debug output a
no-op, so TF_LOG surfaces no provider detail
(qubes-terraform/qubes_provider/utils/qubes_adapter.py:112).
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: L2S-DIAG-03
  ROLE: Refines

